{"id":1030303,"name":"Serpent - Interrogation III","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"Serpent - Interrogation III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1030303]}],"trial":{"trial_id":30303,"stage":"Phase 3","unlock_time":"2022-12-20 14:00:00","diary1":"What you didn't expect, was that the girl with a snake was led to the Endless Carnival.\nThat incident regarding the \"Corpus\" in the Endless Carnival didn't happen back then. So... Could it be that the \"Corpus\" was the source of the Dreamy Bottle and the Ambrosia?\nAnd why is Serpent... so very bent on letting you accept the \"happiness\" she feels?","diary2":"It turns out that the Endless Carnival was where Serpent meet Marv. But to your surprise, Serpent has made Marv her servant.\nBut new mysteries have appeared: Where did Marv come from? Did it have anything to do with that eerie parade of monsters?\nYou don't have time for these questions now, though. Serpent's life force is near the limit, and you have to save her from being controlled by Marv and the Bottle of Dreams.","evidence":[{"ID":260293,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260294,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":3,"dialogue_id":130303012,"next":[13]},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130303013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue